{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and grab it. Move and check its properties. Scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectPropertiesCheck    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
